  "description": "Welcome to 19 Bowline Avenue, Alkimos - a stylish and low-maintenance home perfectly suited to modern coastal living. <br/><br/>Positioned in the sought-after Shorehaven Estate, this nicely presented 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom home offers all you need!<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>3 spacious bedrooms with built-in robes<br/>2 bathrooms<br/>Stainless-steel appliances<br/>Open-plan living and dining<br/>Reverse-cycle air conditioning<br/>Secure double lock-up garage<br/>Low-maintenance gardens<br/><br/>WANT TO VIEW THIS PROPERTY? Simply click the BOOK INSPECTION button and you will immediately be able to see and book into any available viewing times. (if a date isn't currently available you will receive an SMS and Email as soon as it becomes available to view)<br/><br/>To ensure a smooth viewing and application process, please note the following:<br/><br/>1. Please ensure you register to view (note; all attending parties MUST be registered)<br/>2. If a viewing is not available then please be patient, we will notify you as soon as a time becomes available<br/>3. A flyer will be provided at the home open outlining stepÃ¢€'byÃ¢€'step instructions on how to submit your application.<br/>4. Our application processing team will keep you updated on the progress and outcome of your application - please keep in mind that it can take 24-48 working hours to process when many applications are received. We suggest giving your references a heads up that we may be in touch - this will help expedite the process!<br/>5. Please note that only applications submitted via Tenant Options will be considered.<br/><br/>Looking for professional, stress-free property management? Megan McHenry at Harcourts Alliance is here to help. Whether you're after expert advice or just exploring your options, feel free to get in touch for a confidential, no obligation conversation - 0422 808 112 / megan.mchenry@harcourtsalliance.com.au",
